<title>USA: Moneygram in calling card pact with MCI.</title>
<headline>Moneygram in calling card pact with MCI.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc said it is in a three-year pact with MCI Communications Corp to sell MoneyGram long distance calling cards in the United States.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The cards will be available in four denominations -- $5, $10, $20 and $50 -- and priced on a per unit, sliding scale basis:  the higher denomination the card, the lower the cost per unit.</p>
</text>
